1170	 * always present. `drag` (leg b), `timeTracking` (leg c) and `settings` (leg d)
1171	 * are the legs this journey drives: the parser requires all three once a browser
1172	 * has driven the journey, but they are typed optional so a producer can populate
1173	 * them without the not-yet-updated wiring failing to compile.
1174	 */
